smartctl-ps3stor
===============

smartctl-ps3stor is smartctl built on smartmontools 7.4 with a custom
"ps3stor" device type added, used to read SMART information from PS3
storage controllers.  It is based on the upstream branch smart_7.4_ps3stor.

Full documentation:
    README.md     - English README
    README-ZH.md  - 中文说明

Quick usage:
    smartctl --scan
    smartctl -x -d ps3stor,16 /dev/ctrl/1
    smartctl -x -d ps3stor,16 /dev/ctrl/1 -j

CentOS 8 (el8) RPMs for x86_64 / aarch64 are built inside a CentOS 8
container by the GitHub Actions workflow .github/workflows/build-centos8-rpm.yml;
the packaging is defined in smartctl-ps3stor.spec.

